<title>EGYPT: Egypt says seeks 30,000 t soybean for Oct/Nov.</title>
<headline>Egypt says seeks 30,000 t soybean for Oct/Nov.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Egyptian state's Food Industries Company said on Thursday it wanted to buy 30,000 tonnes of soybean, any origin, for arrival in the first half of October and/or the first half of November.</p>
<p>The deadline for bids is noon (0900 GMT) on July 22, Muharram Ghanem, the head of the sales department at the company, told Reuters.</p>
<p>-- Jonathan Wright +20 2 578 3290/1 jw</p>
